            kind: "markdown",
            value: '\nPoskytuje animovan\xE9 p\u0159echodov\xE9 (transition) efekty pro **jeden** element nebo **jednu** komponentu.\n\n- **Props**\n\n  ```ts\n  interface TransitionProps {\n    /**\n     * Slou\u017E\xED k automatick\xE9mu generov\xE1n\xED n\xE1zv\u016F CSS t\u0159\xEDd pro p\u0159echody.\n     * Nap\u0159. `name: \'fade\'` se automaticky roz\u0161\xED\u0159\xED na `.fade-enter`,\n     * `.fade-enter-active` atd.\n     */\n    name?: string\n    /**\n     * Ur\u010Duje, zda se maj\xED CSS t\u0159\xEDdy p\u0159echod\u016F pou\u017E\xEDt.\n     * V\xFDchoz\xED hodnota: true\n     */\n    css?: boolean\n    /**\n     * Ur\u010Duje typ ud\xE1lost\xED p\u0159echod\u016F, na kter\xE9 se m\xE1 \u010Dekat\n     * pro ur\u010Den\xED \u010Dasu ukon\u010Den\xED p\u0159echodu.\n     * V\xFDchoz\xED chov\xE1n\xED je automatick\xE9 detekov\xE1n\xED typu s del\u0161\xED dobou trv\xE1n\xED.\n     */\n    type?: \'transition\' | \'animation\'\n    /**\n     * Ur\u010Duje explicitn\xED doby trv\xE1n\xED p\u0159echodu.\n     * V\xFDchoz\xED chov\xE1n\xED je \u010Dek\xE1n\xED na prvn\xED ud\xE1lost `transitionend`\n     * nebo `animationend` na root elementu p\u0159echodu.\n     */\n    duration?: number | { enter: number; leave: number }\n    /**\n     * Ovl\xE1d\xE1 \u010Dasovou posloupnost p\u0159echod\u016F p\u0159i vstupu/v\xFDstupu.\n     * V\xFDchoz\xED chov\xE1n\xED je sou\u010Dasn\xE9 proveden\xED.\n     */\n    mode?: \'in-out\' | \'out-in\' | \'default\'\n    /**\n     * Ur\u010Duje, zda se m\xE1 p\u0159echod aplikovat p\u0159i po\u010D\xE1te\u010Dn\xEDm vykreslen\xED.\n     * V\xFDchoz\xED hodnota: false\n     */\n    appear?: boolean\n\n    /**\n     * Vlastnosti pro p\u0159izp\u016Fsoben\xED t\u0159\xEDd p\u0159echod\u016F.\n     * V \u0161ablon\xE1ch pou\u017Eijte kebab-case z\xE1pis, nap\u0159. enter-from-class="xxx"\n     */\n    enterFromClass?: string\n    enterActiveClass?: string\n    enterToClass?: string\n    appearFromClass?: string\n    appearActiveClass?: string\n    appearToClass?: string\n    leaveFromClass?: string\n    leaveActiveClass?: string\n    leaveToClass?: string\n  }\n  ```\n\n- **Ud\xE1losti**\n\n  - `@before-enter`\n  - `@before-leave`\n  - `@enter`\n  - `@leave`\n  - `@appear`\n  - `@after-enter`\n  - `@after-leave`\n  - `@after-appear`\n  - `@enter-cancelled`\n  - `@leave-cancelled` (pouze pro `v-show`)\n  - `@appear-cancelled`\n\n- **P\u0159\xEDklad**\n\n  Jednoduch\xFD element:\n\n  ```html\n  <Transition>\n    <div v-if="ok">p\u0159epnut\xFD obsah</div>\n  </Transition>\n  ```\n\n  Vynucen\xED p\u0159echodu zm\u011Bnou atributu `key`:\n\n  ```html\n  <Transition>\n    <div :key="text">{{ text }}</div>\n  </Transition>\n  ```\n\n  Dynamick\xE1 komponenta s re\u017Eimem p\u0159echodu + animace p\u0159i zobrazen\xED:\n\n  ```html\n  <Transition name="fade" mode="out-in" appear>\n    <component :is="view"></component>\n  </Transition>\n  ```\n\n  Naslouch\xE1n\xED ud\xE1lostem p\u0159echodu:\n\n  ```html\n  <Transition @after-enter="onTransitionComplete">\n    <div v-show="ok">p\u0159epnut\xFD obsah</div>\n  </Transition>\n  ```\n\n- **Viz tak\xE9:** [Pr\u016Fvodce \u2013 Transition](https://cs.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html)\n'
