            value: 'Bloky mohou pomoc\xED atributu `lang` deklarovat programovac\xED jazyk, v n\u011Bm\u017E m\xE1 prob\u011Bhnout pre-processing. Nejb\u011B\u017En\u011Bj\u0161\xED p\u0159\xEDpad je pou\u017Eit\xED TypeScriptu pro blok `<script>`:\n\n```html\n<script lang="ts">\n  // pou\u017Eit\xED TypeScriptu\n</script>\n```\n\n`lang` lze pou\u017E\xEDt na jak\xFDkoli blok \u2013 nap\u0159\xEDklad m\u016F\u017Eeme pou\u017E\xEDt `<style>` se [Sass](https://sass-lang.com/) a&nbsp;`<template>` + [Pug](https://pugjs.org/api/getting-started.html):\n\n```html\n<template lang="pug">\np {{ msg }}\n</template>\n\n<style lang="scss">\n  $primary-color: #333;\n  body {\n    color: $primary-color;\n  }\n</style>\n```\n\nDejte pozor, \u017Ee integrace s r\u016Fzn\xFDmi pre-procesory se m\u016F\u017Ee li\u0161it podle zvolen\xE9 sady softwarov\xFDch n\xE1stroj\u016F. Pro p\u0159\xEDklady se pod\xEDvejte do p\u0159\xEDslu\u0161n\xE9 dokumentace:\n\n- [Vite](https://vitejs.dev/guide/features.html#css-pre-processors)\n- [Vue CLI](https://cli.vuejs.org/guide/css.html#pre-processors)\n- [webpack + vue-loader](https://vue-loader.vuejs.org/guide/pre-processors.html#using-pre-processors)'
